    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e\u00a0<strong>Cozy hand-drawn puzzle!\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udc3e<br>Discover cute animals, organise them to fit the grid, and get hypnotised with their eyes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156370/extras/998a8da883e304a1438981542e8e3bb5.poster.avif?t=1753731967\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156370/extras/998a8da883e304a1438981542e8e3bb5.webm?t=1753731967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156370/extras/998a8da883e304a1438981542e8e3bb5.mp4?t=1753731967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>A cozy puzzle game with fluffy, goggle-eyed animals.</strong> \ud83d\udc3e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the perfect spot for all your quirky animal friends in <strong>Eyes That Hypnotise</strong>, a charming puzzle adventure filled with funny big-eyed stares and relaxing vibes. Place adorable creatures on the grid, watch their eyes follow your every move, and uncover a world of cozy, handcrafted puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Will their hypnotic gaze help you solve the puzzle\u2026 or completely distract you?</strong> \u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156370/extras/b6ce1ad39ee3793310510330fecbb5ff.poster.avif?t=1753731967\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156370/extras/b6ce1ad39ee3793310510330fecbb5ff.webm?t=1753731967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156370/extras/b6ce1ad39ee3793310510330fecbb5ff.mp4?t=1753731967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>60 Handcrafted Levels</strong><br>Each puzzle is carefully designed to tickle your brain while keeping things chill and relaxing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0e <strong>5 Unique Chapters</strong><br>Explore different cozy environments\u2014<strong>Home, City, Farm, Forest, and Exotic</strong>\u2014each with its own set of adorable creatures and charming backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd89 <strong>30 Big-Eyed, Quirky Animals</strong><br>Collect a variety of <strong>funny, expressive creatures</strong>, from a snooty borzoi to a sneaky rat, each with a personality of its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc40 <strong>Hilarious, Interactive Eyes</strong><br>Animals\u2019 <strong>eyes follow your cursor</strong>, creating funny, goofy expressions. And when you solve a puzzle\u2014<strong>watch their eyes sparkle with pure joy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156370/extras/dbab60e4684e064459b5f30d90051b5c.poster.avif?t=1753731967\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156370/extras/dbab60e4684e064459b5f30d90051b5c.webm?t=1753731967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156370/extras/dbab60e4684e064459b5f30d90051b5c.mp4?t=1753731967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Animals Collection</strong><br>Unlock and collect <strong>every fluffy friend</strong>, then admire them in your animals collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Multiple Solutions for Every Puzzle</strong><br>Think outside the box! Each puzzle has <strong>several valid solutions</strong>, giving you space to experiment and play your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>A Hint System That Helps\u2014Without Spoiling the Fun</strong><br>Stuck? No worries! Our hint system gives <strong>gentle nudges</strong> while letting you keep the fun of discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156370/extras/90197925b2a77bd4abc065e2859142da.poster.avif?t=1753731967\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156370/extras/90197925b2a77bd4abc065e2859142da.webm?t=1753731967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156370/extras/90197925b2a77bd4abc065e2859142da.mp4?t=1753731967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd8c <strong>Charming Hand-Drawn Art &amp; Animations</strong><br>Each animal is <strong>lovingly illustrated and animated</strong> to bring out its personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>Relaxing Music &amp; Cozy Sound Design</strong><br>Enjoy a <strong>soothing jazz soundtrack</strong> that makes puzzle-solving a relaxing escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd4 <strong>A Crafty Notebook Interface</strong><br>The game\u2019s UI <strong>feels like a cozy scrapbook</strong>, adding to its warm and inviting atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude06 <strong>Funny &amp; Playful Vibes</strong><br>Mess with the animals\u2019 eyes, find all the creatures, enjoy the music, and just <strong>have fun!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156370/extras/99d08735c5a20d053349e9a0539558f5.poster.avif?t=1753731967\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156370/extras/99d08735c5a20d053349e9a0539558f5.webm?t=1753731967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156370/extras/99d08735c5a20d053349e9a0539558f5.mp4?t=1753731967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
